{"symbol":"SIYARAM","yahoo":"SIYARAM.BO","bse":null,"isin":null,"sme":null,"name":"Siyaram Recycling Industries Limited","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Metal Fabrication","website":"https://www.siyaramindustries.co.in","about":"Siyaram Recycling Industries Limited manufactures and recycles nonferrous materials and products in India and internationally. The company offers brass ingots, billets, and rods, as well as brass-based components, such as plumbing and sanitary parts, brass inserts, brass ceramic cartridges/brass spindles, brass valves, and extension nipples, etc. It also provides copper alloy ingots and billets comprising gunmetal ingots, aluminium bronze ingots, silicon bronze ingots, phosphorus bronze ingots, tin bronze ingots, leaded bronze ingots, manganese bronze ingots, bismuth bronze ingots, and brass ingots; brass extrusion rods consisting of free cutting, forging quality, and lead-free brass rods; brass fittings, including brass sanitary fittings, compression fittings, chrome and stop valves, NRV and spherical valves, forged brass ball valves, and center hex type tank connectors; and bath fittings, such as brass faucets and angle valves. In addition, the company segregates brass scraps. It exports its products. The company was incorporated in 2007 and is based in Jamnagar, India.","updated":"2026-09-26T08:32:48+00:00","quote":{"price":35.47,"prevClose":33.79,"marketCap":77.29,"high52":108.95,"low52":31.95,"pe":20.39,"bookValue":59.67,"dividendRate":0.0,"roe":2.95,"shares":2.1789,"insiders":53.62,"institutions":0.0},"prices":{"dates":["2023-12-21","2023-12-22","2023-12-26","2023-12-27","2023-12-28","2023-12-29","2024-01-01","2024-01-02","2024-01-03","2024-01-04","2024-01-05","2024-01-08","2024-01-09","2024-01-10","2024-01-11","2024-01-12","2024-01-15","2024-01-16","2024-01-17","2024-01-18","2024-01-19","2024-01-23","2024-01-24","2024-01-25","2024-01-29","2024-01-30","2024-01-31","2024-02-01","2024-02-02","2024-02-05","2024-02-06","2024-02-07","202